{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0ZhcmV3ZWxsJTIwRG9jJTIwTWFydGluJTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Farewell Doc Martin","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/oD4dd0qTSsbpSFo0GCBmpzikClZ.jpg","description":"Doc Martin, one of UK's iconic TV characters, hangs up his stethoscope for the final time as the long-running titular series comes to an end. This one-hour retrospective spotlights the longevity and impact locally and around the world of Doc Martin over the years, as well as offering behind the scenes of the final season with the cast and crew. From scripting and pre-production to shooting and delivery, meet the regular characters that live and work in the picturesque Cornish town of Portwenn, the key crew behind the camera, the residents of Port Isaac, the show's real-life setting, and the visitors who come solely because Doc Martin films there.\n\nReleased 29 Dec 2022 · United Kingdom · Language: English · 47 min\nStudio: Buffalo Pictures, ITV Studios\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"10.0","runtime":"47 min","cast":["Caroline Catz","Martin Clunes","Joe Absolom","Robyn Addison","Anthony Ainsworth","Eileen Atkins","Johnny Bamford","Selina Cadell"],"director":["Stuart Orme"],"released":"2022-12-29T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Stuart Orme","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bWijgolPwNdpExIzSiqa04mJVtQ.jpg"},{"name":"Caroline Catz","character":"Self - Narrator (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nZn7unhXz5kS537kFJmCB5S2n3Q.jpg"},{"name":"Martin Clunes","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xoCgVr1h3uhES9MnKCoyd05bW1v.jpg"},{"name":"Joe Absolom","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hoBK0DpfBsUh0HP57dzF4QW81d2.jpg"},{"name":"Robyn Addison","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wFhanbkYsbXDcNbNr3hcPrX3GUF.